      "id": "e283",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 1108,
      "width": 866,
      "height": 113,
      "text": "• The orchestrator reads only the status line to decide the next step\n• Two parallel testers return two handoffs; any FAIL starts one fix round\n• \"Same failures as last round\" twice in a row stops the fixing and calls the planner\n• Notes are forwarded to the next agent; suggestions may be adopted or rejected\n• Progress lives in PROGRESS.md: \"/pipeline continue\" resumes after any interruption",
      "originalText": "• The orchestrator reads only the status line to decide the next step\n• Two parallel testers return two handoffs; any FAIL starts one fix round\n• \"Same failures as last round\" twice in a row stops the fixing and calls the planner\n• Notes are forwarded to the next agent; suggestions may be adopted or rejected\n• Progress lives in PROGRESS.md: \"/pipeline continue\" resumes after any interruption",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
